### Windows
# Windows thumbnail cache files
Thumbs.db

# Folder config file
[Dd]esktop.ini

# Recycle Bin used on file shares
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Windows shortcuts
*.lnk
### Game-research heavy assets (keep text docs, ignore binaries/large dumps)
# Videos: raw clips, sidecar metadata, extracted frames (keep transcript.txt / notes.md / *.vtt)
research/**/Videos/**/*.mp4
research/**/Videos/**/*.webm
research/**/Videos/**/*.part
research/**/Videos/**/*.info.json
research/**/Videos/**/frames/
# Wiki: downloaded images (keep the *.md page text)
research/**/Web Sources/wiki/img/
# Review corpora: large raw dumps (keep the digest .md + listing_metadata.json)
research/**/Reviews/*.csv
research/**/Reviews/*.jsonl
research/**/Reviews/sensortower-ios-reviews-raw.json
